    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc4ea1e09c1ab025e354e27c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……对了！训练员。\n反正明天放假，要不要一起过？\n我们两个来玩个游戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e498f87fa77aee4c0de345b24660c362699ba1e51f2c86955fe74ce44144e82a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5607743e53370f9c45f6161",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让、让你久等了，女孩",
      "source_fingerprint": "33120144f0a609ab2fae3e2aeada5e995a5bd2484969142a00794113617eb10c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5026556647d9910722bc4b99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天早上。我已经刻意提早到，\n但一到集合地点，\n富士奇石却已经在那里了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3967da4dc365eb002b8701b69e5d9b548b2334befc0d1273a40a32d865bb7de5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14c2e9f9dea3ee7809c26774",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石",
      "source_fingerprint": "630c9bd72789e662b81a8b83212e911d7bcbf6bb2d055023fb47ed14bb6bbee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
