    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de4e4cb516418fae8c9bc333",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会，没关系。你的脸很红耶，还好吗？\n看到我已经到了，所以跑着过来吧。\n不用这么着急，调整一下呼吸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65aa628183305c7007fb89185b06907989e72430553ad3e8fe1a42cf2453285f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2723591c8317dd77fc8f11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──富士奇石所谓的“游戏”，\n就是要“模仿对方平常的样子”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fe63bc3150de169f11ae2f3e03cd7517243248d43b1ffb4469b6b77da9e09e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bcaa2e578379737b8bddd1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比起语气，更重要的是反应跟态度，\n这是个了解彼此的好机会，\n富士奇石是这么说的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3419819fb17ba893a3340be92d1ac8f56b9cc0f91a974684a6357488619fe28e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e13eb99e4d56e5d282ce4bb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石",
      "source_fingerprint": "630c9bd72789e662b81a8b83212e911d7bcbf6bb2d055023fb47ed14bb6bbee0",
