      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会适时夸奖，充分理解对手，\n还非常体贴周到。\n看起来就是个……成熟能干的大人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87e16a323a623bbc78d504925539808e820ea57c69ce1a1c006aa396161cba1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
