    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60bfd0ad922d58034d7ffb0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……呵呵，怎么样啊？\n你觉得今天的\n“游戏”好玩吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "772116b4b5b947cd887d06ebdd5dfd5a2951903101af3792433197d1e3f4a4b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3dce37212176a81092da6d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像不像这个问题暂且不讨论，\n我一边回忆着平时富士奇石，\n思考她如何行动、如何反应──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d64aa229600299fc1c618f40c5fcb97805f7cceecc61229693e07895ebea34c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eae68528c1351089139f62d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "透过思考这些事情，\n好像变得更深入了解富士奇石了。\n──我将自己的感想告诉富士奇石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc05625f61af2431be4027d111fbbfc34331f04370b3094473c076edd7745af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19cc3f133742a9b794ad5108",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
