      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，好高兴喔。\n我们都度过一段美好的时光，很满足喔。\n──还有……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8d4a9d6ab05e62f4df9e927d0bea49705074b701de6560866a5ffe62d624b2",
